/-!
# Numerical scalar, vector, and addition identities

The stored complementary matrices kill exactly the published column and
covector, whose pairing is one. Packed sums identify their complementary sum
with the input of the separately certified inverse product. Every numerical
premise here is reduced by Lean's kernel.
Source attribution: `Degree320Pair/source/README.md`.
-/
